WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Raw Drive Rush leads into held down-forward HP.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
The held overhead hits Ryu rather than being blocked.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.950
Back HP continues the hit conversion.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.050
Heavy Dimachaerus and its follow-up launch Ryu.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.350
Held standing HP ends the juggle.
